  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/LQlQFBH9/images/63094b4b88c4f5123af0bcd24ef4f741b1224ee5.png\" alt=\"堆叠方块：农夫乐事\"></p><p><strong>将农夫乐事中的绳索与堆叠方块结合，轻松合成！</strong> 这款堆叠方块扩展包让你能使用农夫乐事中的绳索压缩方块，制作出绑扎堆叠方块。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stacked-blocks-farmers-delight/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=26.1&amp;showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下载 26.1 更新\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a></p><h2>🧺 特性</h2><ul>\n<li>使用农夫乐事中的绳索压缩诸如原木、石头、下界岩、西瓜等方块。</li>\n<li>制作堆叠沃土，日后种植作物更佳。</li>\n<li>节省宝贵的箱子空间，方便存放农业资源。</li>\n</ul><h2>✨ 无缝整合</h2><ul>\n<li>只需合成绳索，即可制作堆叠方块！<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此下载农夫乐事</a>。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"攒钱买笔记本电脑！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按钮\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐赠按钮\"></a></p>",
